id: ops-publish-indirection
title: Reject unresolved alias and function publish indirection in canonical attestation auditor
description: "Canonical repair for GitHub issue #149. Real shell aliases, forwarding functions and variable-routed xargs can execute unattested publishes while a sanctioned sibling satisfies non-vacuity. Companion owner: pm-cli-website-session-2026-10-10."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 0
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-10T02:41:49.896Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-10T09:02:36.846Z"
assignee: codex-nested-closure
claim_principal: codex-nested-closure
author: codex-sol
acceptance_criteria: Real subprocess adversarial fixtures and independent revert proofs; reject unresolved executable indirection; preserve sanctioned workflow; full release and packed npm/Bun checks.
repro_steps: Execute test/publish-indirection.test.ts against the prior attestation implementation; Bash/xargs inert publisher records show hidden publish calls behind an attested sibling.
expected_result: Every unresolved executable publisher path is refused; direct sanctioned provenance workflows and provable bindings remain accepted.
actual_result: "Renewed findings4236759848/9852/9854 repaired. Source c8e15db197f2834de9a0f3279224ce5cf0f9ed3f CI38033875668 passes Linux22/26 and nativeWindows22/26; CodeQL38033875790 passes. Actual npm/npx11.21.0 is asserted; accepted historical proof fails without the diagnostic and repaired source refuses missing objects clearly. Both old launcher source-only controls fail and restore; actual npm10.9.4 is refused before pack. Local release503/505 with2 unchanged opt-in skips and all23production four100, focused34/34, PM-linked3/3, compatibility6/6 and fresh npm/nativeBun packed consumers pass. Five high development findings,12 legacy completeness gaps, ambient extension-health skew and incomplete whole-internal docs/review remain. PM/evidence-only handoff follows; root verifies/closes."
